Exp 2d:Leap Year

Aim:
To write a Java program to check whether a given year is a leap year or not.

Algorithm:
1. Start the program.
2. Import the Scanner package.
3. Read a year from the user.
4. Check whether the year is divisible by 400, or divisible by 4 but not by 100.
5. If the condition is true, print Leap Year; otherwise, print Not a Leap Year.
6. Stop the program.

Program:

import java.util.Scanner;

public class LeapYear {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int year;

        System.out.print("Enter a year: ");
        year = sc.nextInt();

        if (year % 400 == 0 ||
            (year % 4 == 0 && year % 100 != 0)) {
            System.out.println("Leap Year");
        } else {
            System.out.println("Not a Leap Year");
        }

        sc.close();
    }
}



